    },
    "删的是你服务器上的五份副本；手机上的数据、系统权限都不动。删完智能体就查不到这些清单了。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This deletes the five copies on your server. The data on your phone and system permissions are untouched. Afterwards the agent won't be able to look these lists up."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bu, sunucunuzdaki beş kopyayı siler. Telefonunuzdaki veriler ve sistem izinleri etkilenmez. Sonrasında ajan bu listeleri sorgulayamaz."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "删的是你服务器上的五份副本；手机上的数据、系统权限都不动。删完智能体就查不到这些清单了。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "刪的是你伺服器上的五份副本；手機上的資料、系統權限都不動。刪完智慧代理就查不到這些清單了。"
          }
        }
      }
