    "批准后这条记忆会保存下来、长期生效；驳回则不会保存。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Once approved, this memory is saved and stays in effect long-term. If rejected, it isn't saved."
